---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy">
  <div class="container py-16 max-w-4xl">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-heading font-bold mb-8">Privacy Policy</h1>
    
    <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none">
      <p class="text-slate-600 mb-6">Last updated: December 2, 2025</p>
      
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-4">Data Collection</h2>
      <p class="mb-4">
        This website uses Google Analytics to understand how visitors interact with the site. 
        Analytics are only activated after you provide explicit consent via the cookie banner.
      </p>
      
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-4">Cookies and Tracking</h2>
      <p class="mb-4">
        <strong>Google Analytics:</strong> When you accept cookies, we use Google Analytics to collect 
        anonymous usage statistics. This includes:
      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 mb-4">
        <li>Pages visited and time spent on the site</li>
        <li>Browser type and device information</li>
        <li>Approximate geographic location (country/city level)</li>
        <li>Referral source (how you found this website)</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="mb-4">
        We have enabled IP anonymization, meaning your full IP address is not stored. 
        The data is processed by Google LLC in accordance with their privacy policy.
      </p>
      <p class="mb-4">
        <strong>Consent Cookie:</strong> We store a small cookie in your browser to remember your 
        cookie consent choice. This cookie contains no personal information and only records whether 
        you accepted or declined analytics.
      </p>
      <p class="mb-4">
        You can withdraw your consent at any time by clearing your browser cookies and declining 
        when the banner appears again.
      </p>
      
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-4">Server Logs</h2>
      <p class="mb-4">
        Like most websites, our hosting provider may automatically collect standard server log information 
        including IP addresses, browser type, and access times for technical and security purposes. 
        This data is not used for tracking or profiling.
      </p>
      
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-4">Contact</h2>
      <p class="mb-4">
        If you contact us via email, we will only use your contact information to respond to your inquiry. 
        We do not store or share this information with third parties.
      </p>
      
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-4">External Links</h2>
      <p class="mb-4">
        This website may contain links to external sites. We are not responsible for the privacy 
        practices of other websites.
      </p>
      
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-4">Third-Party Services</h2>
      <p class="mb-4">
        <strong>Google Analytics:</strong> This service is provided by Google LLC, 1600 Amphitheatre Parkway, 
        Mountain View, CA 94043, USA. For more information about how Google processes data, visit 
        <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-red-600 hover:text-red-700">
          Google's Privacy Policy
        </a>.
      </p>
      <p class="mb-4">
        Legal basis for processing: Your explicit consent (Art. 6 para. 1 lit. a GDPR). 
        Data transfer to the USA is based on the EU-US Data Privacy Framework.
      </p>
      
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-4">Your Rights</h2>
      <p class="mb-4">
        Under the GDPR, you have the right to:
      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 mb-4">
        <li>Access your personal data</li>
        <li>Rectify inaccurate data</li>
        <li>Request deletion of your data</li>
        <li>Object to data processing</li>
        <li>Data portability</li>
        <li>Withdraw consent at any time</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="mb-4">
        To exercise these rights, please contact us at the email address below.
      </p>
      
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-4">Changes to This Policy</h2>
      <p class="mb-4">
        We may update this privacy policy from time to time. Any changes will be posted on this page.
      </p>
      
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-4">Contact Information</h2>
      <p class="mb-4">
        If you have questions about this privacy policy, please contact us at: 
        <a href="mailto:plagarufus@gmail.com" class="text-red-600 hover:text-red-700">plagarufus@gmail.com</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>